        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek BTB-86721, Back-to-Back Modern Keaton Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Keaton Back-to-Back Handle Pair is a modern style, rectangular front door pull. It is available in 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths. Choose from a variety of contemporary finish colors. The Back-to-Back Modern Keaton Door Pull Set comes packaged with the hardware to mount them back to back on a single door (one on the interior and one on the exterior).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/keaton-door-handle-emtek-86721\"><b>Keaton Pulls with Thru-Bolt Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Back-to-Back Keaton Front Door Handle Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) door pulls,  (2) 2-1/2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) #10-32 set screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86721-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262383\"><b>Emtek Keaton Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-86721:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Thickness: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-86722:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Thickness: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
